# NOTE: The trained weights (~510 MB best_model.pt) and vocab_100k.json live
# OUTSIDE this repo, in UATS_MODEL_DIR (default D:\Urdu_text); nothing copies
# them in, so they are never committed. If weights are ever added on purpose,
# .gitattributes routes *.pt / *.npy through Git LFS automatically.

